> Root Cause Analysis and Resolution:
> Identified a rogue analytical query holding an exclusive table lock on TB_CUST_ACCOUNTS. Terminated the offending SPID session, flushed the lock tables, and re-executed Batch Job #48 successfully. Added an explicit lock timeout and enforced the hard-stop limit rule on negative balances.
> 
